<title>USA: Dynamics says court denies WHX motion.</title>
<headline>Dynamics says court denies WHX motion.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynamics Corp of America said Friday that a U.S. District Court rejected WHX Corp's motion to compel Dynamics to redeem its shareholder rights plan to enable WHX's tender offer to proceed.</p>
<p>Dynamics Corp said shareholders accept CTS Corp's tender offer for 50 percent of Dynamics shares at a price of $56.25 a share. All shares not purchased in the tender offer will be converted into 0.88 shares of CTS stock.</p>
<p>WHX's tender offer is for $56 a share for all shares.</p>
<p>WHX and CTS Corp's respective tender offers will expire midnight tonight.</p>
